msgid ""
"This validation demonstrates internal consistency, bounded execution and "
"reproducibility of the educational alpha. It is not a cryptographic audit, "
"certification, production hardening review or post-quantum claim. External "
"targets, arbitrary shell execution, real `.env` files and provider "
"credentials remain outside the alpha."
msgstr ""
"This validation demonstrates internal consistency, bounded execution and "
"reproducibility of the educational alpha. It is not a cryptographic audit, "
"certification, production hardening review or post-quantum claim. External "
"targets, arbitrary shell execution, real `.env` files and provider "
"credentials remain outside the alpha."
